  "instructions": [
    "Grill the chopped onion over medium heat until it is lightly charred.",
    "In a large pot, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger to the pot and cook until fragrant.",
    "Add the ground cumin and coriander to the pot and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the tomato paste to the pot and cook for 2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the split peas, water, salt, and black pepper to the pot and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer the stew for 45 minutes, or until the peas are tender.",
    "Stir in the grilled onion and serve the stew hot."
